%% Sprint stats-themes-linking-1 (RF-02 + RF-06)
%% Reverse lookup: GET /api/stats/:statId/linked-themes
%% ADR-141: GIN index global em study_themes.linked_stats; cache memoria 60s.
%% Pattern lesson #21: Map<string, {data, expiresAt}> + invalidator publico.
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Drawer as StatsAnalyzer drawer<br/>(client/src/pages/StatsAnalyzer.tsx)
    participant API as GET /api/stats/:statId/linked-themes<br/>(server/routes/stats.ts NEW)
    participant Cache as statsLinkedThemesCache<br/>(Map<string,{data,expiresAt}> TTL 60s)
    participant Catalog as STAT_INDEX_BY_ID<br/>+ hudLayouts.fieldsJson
    participant Storage as storage.ts<br/>(Drizzle raw sql)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16<br/>(GIN idx_study_themes_linked_stats_gin)

    User->>Drawer: Click stat card no Stats Analyzer
    Drawer->>API: GET /api/stats/{statId}/linked-themes<br/>(JWT auth header)
    API->>API: requireAuth -> ctx.userPlatformId

    Note over API,Catalog: Validacao do statId (catalog OU custom_*)
    alt prefix custom_*
        API->>Storage: getUserHudLayouts(userId)
        Storage->>DB: SELECT fields_json FROM hud_layouts WHERE user_id=$1
        DB-->>Storage: rows
        API->>API: Verificar fieldsJson[i].id === statId
    else catalog
        API->>Catalog: STAT_INDEX_BY_ID.has(statId)
        Catalog-->>API: bool
    end
    alt statId invalido
        API-->>Drawer: 404 { message: 'Stat nao encontrada' }
        Drawer-->>User: Mensagem inline (sem retry)
    end

    Note over API,Cache: Cache lookup
    API->>Cache: get(`${userId}:${statId}`)
    alt CACHE HIT (entry.expiresAt > now)
        Cache-->>API: { data: themes[] }
        Note right of Cache: <5ms (RF-02.5)
        API-->>Drawer: 200 themes[]
    else CACHE MISS / EXPIRED
        Cache->>Cache: cache.delete(key) se expirado
        Cache-->>API: undefined
        API->>Storage: getThemesLinkingStat(userId, statId)
        Note over Storage,DB: GIN containment query
        Storage->>DB: SELECT id, name, slug, category<br/>FROM study_themes<br/>WHERE user_id=$1<br/>  AND linked_stats @> to_jsonb(ARRAY[$2]::text[])<br/>ORDER BY name ASC
        Note right of DB: Bitmap Index Scan on<br/>idx_study_themes_linked_stats_gin<br/>(p95 <50ms RF-02.5)
        DB-->>Storage: rows[]
        Storage-->>API: themes[]
        API->>Cache: set(`${userId}:${statId}`, { data: themes, expiresAt: now+60s })
        API-->>Drawer: 200 themes[]
    end

    Drawer->>Drawer: Render chips clicaveis<br/>(name + badge category)
    User->>Drawer: Click chip de tema
    Drawer-->>User: Wouter navigate /estudos/:slug

    Note over API,Cache: Invalidacao acontece em outro fluxo:<br/>RF-01 PATCH theme.linkedStats<br/>RF-08 PATCH hud-layouts custom field linkedThemes<br/>RF-08.5 DELETE custom field
